-XHaskell2010
-XBangPatterns
-XDeriveDataTypeable
-XDeriveGeneric
-XDeriveLift
-XFlexibleContexts
-XFlexibleInstances
-XLambdaCase
-XMagicHash
-XMultiWayIf
-XNamedFieldPuns
-XPatternSynonyms
-XRankNTypes
